1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,670
5 words to never say in sales.

2
00:00:03,850 --> 00:00:12,490
[PAIRS - rapid fire]
Don't say buy, instead say invest - because people people invest

3
00:00:12,670 --> 00:00:15,790
in value, not purchases.

4
00:00:15,970 --> 00:00:23,170
Don't say sign, instead say authorize - authorizing feels like a choice, not a trap.

5
00:00:23,350 --> 00:00:30,210
Don't say customer, instead say client - clients feel like partners, customers feel

6
00:00:30,390 --> 00:00:32,430
like numbers.

7
00:00:32,610 --> 00:00:39,520
Don't say problem, instead say concern - concerns get solved, problems get blamed.

8
00:00:39,700 --> 00:00:46,400
Don't say contract, instead say agreement - agreements are mutual, contracts feel

9
00:00:46,580 --> 00:00:48,520
one-sided.

10
00:00:48,700 --> 00:00:52,920
Your sales does not have to sound like everyone else's.

11
00:00:53,100 --> 00:00:57,110
Comment 'START' and I will send you the full list.

12
00:00:57,290 --> 00:01:01,590
Make sure you follow - it only goes to followers.
